<xsd:annotation xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
<xsd:documentation xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">A core value adding customer offering Product is a good or service that can be refined for the purpose of sale or purchase by the Financial Institution, its competitors, and other Involved Parties, OR in which the Financial Institution has an interest during the normal course of its business activity. For example, Current Account is a Product that can be refined to create a 'Dezign Banking Current Account' which can be offered for sale. e.g. A product must be able to stand up conceptually on its own feet either as a "Plain Vanilla" or "As part of an Offer after refinement" that can be sold/purchased/consumed. A Product that fulfills the criterion of ���������As a Plain Vanilla��������� can be termed as a ���������Base Product���������. For ex: Current Account. A Product that fulfills the criterion of ���������AS part of an Offer after refinement��������� can be an aggregate of two or more existing products and can have its own set of product components. Ex: Savvy Bundle. </xsd:documentation>
</xsd:annotation>
